  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      349.27,
      401.88,
      374.97
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Ports and AirportsDevelopment Levy Act, No. of 2011.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      265.77,
      386.32,
      298.03,
      400.17
    ],
    "text": "PART I",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      181.29,
      410.83,
      382.41,
      424.17
    ],
    "text": "IMPOSITION OF PORTS AND AIRPORTS DEVELOPMENT LEVY",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      435.43,
      402.07,
      510.21
    ],
    "text": "2.Subject to the provisions of section 7, there shall becharged and levied on the cost, insurance and freight valueof every article originating from outside Sri Lanka andimported into Sri Lanka, a levy to be called the Ports andAirports Development Levy ( hereinafter in this Part referredto as the \u201cLevy\u201d).",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      521.47,
      402.2,
      571.77
    ],
    "text": "3.(1) The levy to be charged and levied in respect ofthe cost, insurance and freight value of any article referredto in section 2 shall be calculated, at the rate of 5.0 percentum, for the period commencing on January 1, 2011.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      583.03,
      402.34,
      620.97
    ],
    "text": "(2) With effect from January 1, 2011, no levy shall becharged in respect on the cost, insurance and freight valueof any article imported into Sri Lanka\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      632.23,
      387.02,
      645.57
    ],
    "text": "(a)for the purpose of processing and re-export; or",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      656.83,
      401.95,
      670.17
    ],
    "text": "(b)to be used for the manufacture of goods for exports.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
